chapter start
name: section-steps
title start
name: title-steps
Steps
title end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-step-m2-boxes
Step M2. Draw the master view. The wasm reads the index, draws
one box per file with its title, and draws the links between
files as connections. Done when a test page shows every file of
a small folder as a box with its links.
contract start
id: q5e9296
question: Is each step one action that can be finished and checked?
contract end
answer start
for: q5e9296
asked: Is each step one action that can be finished and checked?
Yes. One action: draw every file as a box with its links on a test page.

answer end
paragraph end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-step-m3-expand
Step M3. Expand by key. Written only after M2 works and Shape
has chosen the keys and the options. Done when this step has its
own plan lines.
contract start
id: q5e9296
question: Is each step one action that can be finished and checked?
contract end
answer start
for: q5e9296
asked: Is each step one action that can be finished and checked?
No. It is a placeholder that waits for decisions, not one action.

answer end
paragraph end
